-Integrating over the Milky Way stellar population ($N_\star \approx 10^{11}$ stars):
-$$L_{\mathrm{excess}} = f_{\mathrm{intro}} N_\star (\dot{I} k_B T_{\mathrm{rad}} \ln 2)$$
